  /// Peer-side premium-cosmetic gate. Frames, covers and emoji statuses are
  /// paid-only. A peer publishes them only while paid (premium_badge='1') and
  /// republishes null when premium lapses — but until that peer refreshes, stale
  /// cached meta can still carry a premium cosmetic with no badge, so we ALSO
  /// gate at read time. FAILS OPEN: when monetization is globally off
  /// (kill-switch) nobody carries a badge yet everything must show, so the value
  /// is returned untouched. Gating at read (not on store) preserves the peer's
  /// choice so it restores automatically if they upgrade again.
  String? _gatedPeerCosmetic(
    String? value, {
    required bool peerHasBadge,
    CosmeticKind? kind,
  }) {
    if (value == null || value.isEmpty) return null;
    if (!entitlementStateNow.monetizationEnabled) return value; // fail open
    if (kind != null && isCosmeticFree(kind, value)) {
      return value; // free preset
    }
    return peerHasBadge ? value : null;
  }

