          // its ratchet — our session row was overwritten by responderAccept
          // inside decryptFromWire. Any outbox messages we still have pending
          // toward this peer are encrypted with stale chain keys and will
          // fail on the peer side. Drop them so the queue doesn't poison the
          // freshly-rebuilt session.
