              // us via a fresh X3DH prekey, which we have now adopted (responder
              // side, no send chain yet). The peer who reset cannot decrypt us
              // until WE send on this new session. Fire ONE debounced confirm
              // ping back on the adopted session (a `session` wire — NOT another
              // prekey) so the reverse direction heals automatically. Without
              // this, B→A only recovers on B's next ORGANIC send, leaving A
              // unable to decrypt B in the meantime (half-open convergence).
