          // skip the session-reset escalation below, so a replay could only
          // ever report the failure — never fix it. Once every wire from a peer is
          // parked there are no FRESH failures left to trigger that
          // escalation, and the backlog spins forever: on a live device 18
          // wires re-failed every second with no quarantine, no NACK (already
          // claimed) and no reset. Nothing could ever unstick it.
          //
          // A parked wire that still will not decrypt IS the evidence that the
          // ratchet with this peer is broken, so drive the same repair the
